  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Welcome to the wild world of BW Blacksmith Coffee Co., where we take our beans as seriously as never missing a morning cup of joe.&nbsp; We're a tight-knit family-owned brand on a mission to brew up some serious coffee perfection.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Our beans are roasted to order, ensuring they're fresher than a morning breeze and bolder than your Aunt Mildred's fashion choices. And we don't mess around with unnecessary frills &ndash; it's all about that pure, unadulterated coffee goodness.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Family is at the heart of our brand, and we'd love for you to check out \"The Man Behind the Brand\" to learn why it means so much to us.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Product description:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Introducing our coffee: It's like a slap of freshness to your morning routine! Our beans are so fresh, they practically leap out of the bag and into your cup, ready to kick-start your day. Picture this: each bean is like a little comedian doing stand-up in your coffee mug, delivering punchlines of flavor with every sip. It's like your taste buds are at a comedy club, and our coffee is headlining the show! So say goodbye to stale, boring coffee and hello to a fresh, bold but smoothbrew that'll have you laughing all the way to your next refill.</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our product is simple, No - FLuff, nor crazy flavors just an amazing smooth, bold cup of coffee. Roasted fresh to order and shipped directly to your doorstep.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br><br></p>",
